rent dark:hover:bg-accent/50 focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-[3px] size-8\" da-cid=\"more-actions\" id=\"radix-_r_1t_\" aria-haspopup=\"menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-ellipsis h-4 w-4\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1\"></circle><circle cx=\"19\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1\"></circle><circle cx=\"5\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1\"></circle></svg><span class=\"sr-only\">More actions</span></button></div></div><div class=\"relative flex min-h-0 flex-1 flex-col overflow-auto rounded-md border border-border bg-card p-4 [&amp;&gt;div]:flex-1\"><div data-state=\"active\" data-orientation=\"horizontal\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"radix-_r_1l_-trigger-markdown\" id=\"radix-_r_1l_-content-markdown\" tabindex=\"0\" data-slot=\"tabs-content\" class=\"flex-1 outline-none\" style=\"\"><div class=\"text-xs\"><div class=\"flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col\"><div class=\"w-full overflow-x-auto\"><div class=\"inline-block min-w-full align-top\"><div class=\"prose prose-sm prose-slate dark:prose-invert max-w-none\"><div class=\"markdown-container\"><div class=\"item-section px-2 cursor-pointer transition-all duration-200 hover:bg-primary/5 hover:shadow-sm hover:-translate-y-px rounded\" data-index=\"0\" data-item-type=\"header\">\n<p class=\"mb-4 text-base text-foreground\" node=\"[object Object]\">Raspberry Pi Pico Datasheet</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"item-section px-2 cursor-pointer transition-all duration-200 hover:bg-primary/5 hover:shadow-sm hover:-translate-y-px rounded\" data-index=\"1\" data-item-type=\"heading\">\n<h2 class=\"mb-4 text-xl font-bold\" node=\"[object Object]\">2.3. Recommended operating conditions</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"item-section px-2 cursor-pointer transition-all duration-200 hover:bg-primary/5 hover:shadow-sm hover:-translate-y-px rounded\" data-index=\"2\" data-item-type=\"text\">\n<p class=\"mb-4 text-base text-foreground\" node=\"[object Object]\">Operating conditions for the Raspberry Pi Pico are largely a function of the operating conditions specified by its components.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"item-section px-2 cursor-pointer transition-all duration-200 hover:bg-primary/5 hover:shadow-sm hover:-translate-y-px rounded\" data-index=\"3\" data-item-type=\"table\">\n<div class=\"my-4 overflow-x-auto\"><table class=\"min-w-full border border-border\" node=\"[object Object]\"><tbody node=\"[object Object]\"><tr class=\"border-b border-border\" node=\"[object Object]\"><td class=\"border-r border-border !px-4 py-2\" node=\"[object Object]\">**Operating Temp Max**</td><td class=\"border-r border-border !px-4 py-2\" node=\"[object Object]\">85°C (including self-heating)</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-border\" node=\"[object Object]\"><td class=\"border-r border-border !px-4 py-2\" node=\"[object Object]\">**Operating Temp Min**</td><td class=\"border-r border-border !px-4 py-2\" node=\"[object Object]\">-20°C</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-border\" node=\"[object Object]\"><td class=\"border-r border-border !px-4 py-2\" node=\"[object Object]\">**VBUS**</td><td class=\"border-r border-border !px-4 py-2\" node=\"[object Object]\">5V ± 10%.</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-border\" node=\"[object Object]\"><td class=\"border-r border-border !px-4 py-2\" node=\"[object Object]\">**VSYS Min**</td><td class=\"border-r border-border !px-4 py-2\" node=\"[object Object]\">1.8V</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-border\" node=\"[object Object]\"><td class=\"border-r border-border !px-4 py-2\" node=\"[object Object]\">**VSYS Max**</td><td class=\"border-r border-border !px-4 py-2\" node=\"[object Object]\">5.5V</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"item-section px-2 cursor-pointer transition-all duration-200 hover:bg-primary/5 hover:shadow-sm hover:-translate-y-px rounded\" data-index=\"4\" data-item-type=\"text\">\n<p class=\"mb-4 text-base text-foreground\" node=\"[object Object]\">Note that VBUS and VSYS current will depend on use-case, some examples are given in the next section.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"item-section px-2 cursor-pointer transition-all duration-200 hover:bg-primary/5 hover:shadow-sm hover:-translate-y-px rounded\" data-index=\"5\" data-item-type=\"text\">\n<p class=\"mb-4 text-base text-foreground\" node=\"[object Object]\">Recommended maximum ambient temperature of operation is 70°C.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"item-section px-2 cursor-pointer transition-all duration-200 hover:bg-primary/5 hover:shadow-sm hover:-translate-y-px rounded space-y-2 mb-4\" data-index=\"6\" data-item-type=\"footer\">\n<p class=\"mb-4 text-base text-foreground\" node=\"[object Object]\">2.3. Recommended operating conditions</p>\n<p class=\"mb-4 text-base text-foreground\" node=\"[object Object]\">&lt;page_number&gt;11&lt;/page_number&gt;</p>\n</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-state=\"inactive\" data-orientation=\"horizontal\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"radix-_r_1l_-trigger-revisions\" hidden=\"\" id=\"radix-_r_1l_-content-revisions\" tabindex=\"0\" data-slot=\"tabs-content\" class=\"flex-1 outline-none\"></div><div data-state=\"inactive\" data-orientation=\"horizontal\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"radix-_r_1l_-trigger-text\" hidden=\"\" id=\"radix-_r_1l_-content-text\" tabindex=\"0\" data-slot=\"tabs-content\" class=\"flex-1 outline-none\"></div><div data-state=\"inactive\" data-orientation=\"horizontal\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"radix-_r_1l_-trigger-json\" hidden=\"\" id=\"radix-_r_1l_-content-json\" tabindex=\"0\" data-slot=\"tabs-content\" class=\"flex-1 outline-none\"></div><div data-state=\"inactive\" data-orientation=\"horizontal\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"radix-_r_1l_-trigger-forms\" hidden=\"\" id=\"radix-_r_1l_-content-forms\" tabindex=\"0\" data-slot=\"tabs-content\" class=\"flex-1 outline-none\"></div><div data-state=\"inactive\" data-orientation=\"horizontal\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"radix-_r_1l_-trigger-images\" hidden=\"\" id=\"radix-_r_1l_-content-images\" tabindex=\"0\" data-slot=\"tabs-content\" class=\"flex-1 outline-none\"></div><div data-state=\"inactive\" data-orientation=\"horizontal\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"radix-_r_1l_-trigger-xlsx\" hidden=\"\" id=\"radix-_r_1l_-content-xlsx\" tabindex=\"0\" data-slot=\"tabs-content\" class=\"flex-1 outline-none\"></div><div data-state=\"inactive\" data-orientation=\"horizontal\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"radix-_r_1l_-trigger-pdf\" hidden=\"\" id=\"radix-_r_1l_-content-pdf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-slot=\"tabs-content\" class=\"flex-1 outline-none\"></div></div></div></div>",
  "text": "Markdown\nPrevious page\nof 3\nNext page\nCopy\nView options\nMore actions\n\nRaspberry Pi Pico Datasheet\n\n2.3. Recommended operating conditions\n\nOperating conditions for the Raspberry Pi Pico are largely a function of the operating conditions specified by its components.\n\n**Operating Temp Max**\t85°C (including self-heating)\n**Operating Temp Min**\t-20°C\n**VBUS**\t5V ± 10%.\n**VSYS Min**\t1.8V\n**VSYS Max**\t5.5V\n\nNote that VBUS and VSYS current will depend on use-case, some examples are given in the next section.\n\nRecommended maximum ambient temperature of operation is 70°C.\n\n2.3. Recommended operating conditions\n\n<page_number>11</page_number>"
}